// L2 워커 배선 통합 검증(비용 0·위키 변경 0): enqueue → 워커 dequeue → processIngestJob graceful-exit → completed.
import { config } from "dotenv";
config();
const { PrismaClient } = await import("@prisma/client");
const prisma = new PrismaClient();
const { getBoss, enqueueIngest, startIngestWorker, INGEST_QUEUE } = await import("./lib/queue.ts");

const boss = await getBoss();
if (!boss) { console.log("FAIL: boss null"); process.exit(1); }

// 워커 가동(instrumentation이 부팅 시 하는 것과 동일 경로).
await startIngestWorker();

// 존재하지 않는 jobId/sourceId → processIngestJob은 'job 없음' 로그 후 return(throw 없음 → completed).
const jobId = 987654321;
const sendId = await boss.send(INGEST_QUEUE, { ingestJobId: jobId, sourceId: jobId }, {});
console.log("enqueued pgboss job:", sendId);

// 폴링: 그 잡이 completed 될 때까지(최대 ~20s).
let state = "?";
for (let i = 0; i < 40; i++) {
  await new Promise((r) => setTimeout(r, 500));
  const rows: { state: string }[] = await prisma.$queryRawUnsafe(
    "select state from pgboss.job where id = $1::uuid union all select state from pgboss.archive where id = $1::uuid", sendId,
  );
  if (rows.length) { state = rows[0].state; if (state === "completed" || state === "failed") break; }
}
console.log("final pgboss job state:", state);
console.log(state === "completed" ? "PASS: 워커가 잡을 처리하고 정상 완료" : `UNEXPECTED: ${state}`);

// 정리
await prisma.$executeRawUnsafe("delete from pgboss.job where id = $1::uuid", sendId).catch(() => {});
await prisma.$executeRawUnsafe("delete from pgboss.archive where id = $1::uuid", sendId).catch(() => {});
await boss.stop({ graceful: false });
setTimeout(() => process.exit(state === "completed" ? 0 : 2), 800);

